; Ein's arrival blast -- the burst that erupts when his charge reaches the locked point
; (ein.gd::_spawn_explosion). Instanced INSIDE the explosion Strike (which owns the hitbox +
; self-frees); this is the look only. Matches the death-burst palette: a white core flash, a
; magenta/purple + cyan shard burst radiating out. Both one-shot so they fire once.

